{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01PbRkQYFbNrPi64nzBxKBy8", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suku_Mapur\"}, {\"url\": \"https://repository.unpar.ac.id/handle/123456789/15192\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/377059628_Tergerusnya_kearifan_lokal_orang_Mapur_di_tengah_ekspansi_Perkebunan_Kelapa_Sawit_PT_GPL_di_Dusun_Air_Abik_Kabupaten_Bangka\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.forestdigest.com/detail/834/ekowisata-pulau-punggur-di-bangka-belitung\"}, {\"url\": \"https://orasi.unmul.ac.id/file/ilmiah_guru/prof-ir-ndan-imang-mp-phd\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orang_Asli\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orang_Asal\"}, {\"url\": \"https://bekaespedia.com/orang-mapor-etnis-di-pulau-bangka-yang-penuh-legenda-dan-mistis/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://read.bookcreator.com/7JQC4sMns7Q9o23eDva6myHWTBx1/I_6BdTcZTOStWRexG3sbXQ/wyBsGhQ4S5GIRiPxHVMGag\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:18:37.638Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Orang Mapur wikipedia ladang berpindah menggunakan", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01MKLEJfTLMbqYM5JUh6frbx", "content": [{"title": "Suku Mapur - Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia, ensiklopedia bebas", "url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suku_Mapur"}, {"title": "Tektonika rumah adat orang Mapur (Lom) Bangka : objek studi Memarong Air Abik dan Uma Panggong Nek Anya", "url": "https://repository.unpar.ac.id/handle/123456789/15192"}, {"title": "(PDF) Tergerusnya kearifan lokal orang Mapur di tengah ekspansi Perkebunan Kelapa Sawit PT. GPL di Dusun Air Abik, Kabupaten Bangka", "url": "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/377059628_Tergerusnya_kearifan_lokal_orang_Mapur_di_tengah_ekspansi_Perkebunan_Kelapa_Sawit_PT_GPL_di_Dusun_Air_Abik_Kabupaten_Bangka"}, {"title": "Ekowisata Berbasis Kearifan Lokal", "url": "https://www.forestdigest.com/detail/834/ekowisata-pulau-punggur-di-bangka-belitung"}, {"title": "Hak cipta ada pada penulis UNIVERSITAS MULAWARMAN ORASI ILMIAH GURU BESAR", "url": "https://orasi.unmul.ac.id/file/ilmiah_guru/prof-ir-ndan-imang-mp-phd"}, {"title": "Orang Asli", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orang_Asli"}, {"title": "Orang Asal", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orang_Asal"}, {"title": "Orang Mapor, Etnis Di Pulau Bangka Yang Penuh Legenda dan Mistis - bekaespedia.com", "url": "https://bekaespedia.com/orang-mapor-etnis-di-pulau-bangka-yang-penuh-legenda-dan-mistis/"}, {"title": "Book Creator", "url": "https://read.bookcreator.com/7JQC4sMns7Q9o23eDva6myHWTBx1/I_6BdTcZTOStWRexG3sbXQ/wyBsGhQ4S5GIRiPxHVMGag"}]}, "The Indonesian Wikipedia article on Suku Mapur says the inland Orang Mapur still practice shifting cultivation (ladang berpindah) with simple tools, such as machetes and adzes. They move around, but usually return to a field they planted about three years later. Coastal communities differ: they farm more settled plots over long periods, and most grow coconut, pepper, and rubber.\n\nOther sources agree on the core picture:\n- A university paper describes the Orang Mapur (Lom) as growing crops using swidden fields (ume) and living in stilt houses in the forest near their fields. It also notes that resettlement into villages in the 1980s separated people from their fields.\n- A Forest Digest article says inland Mapur people mainly farm using shifting cultivation, along with gardening and hunting.\n- A local profile reports that nearly all residents make a living as field farmers and keep up the tradition of shifting cultivation.\n- A research paper on palm oil expansion says plantation companies have taken over much of the customary forest the Mapur used for their livelihoods.\n\nSources differ on how widespread shifting cultivation remains. The Wikipedia text describes it as practiced mainly inland, while one local profile describes almost all residents as shifting farmers. The Wikipedia article also notes that the origins of the Mapur are uncertain."], "durationSeconds": 5.767452416, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01PbRkQYFbNrPi64nzBxKBy8", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
